          "end_col": 20
        },
        "actual": "\"HTTP\"",
        "expected": "protocol = \"HTTPS\""
      },
      "remediation": "Enforce TLS 1.2+. Replace HTTP listeners with HTTPS, set a modern TLS policy (e.g. `ELBSecurityPolicy-TLS13-1-2-2021-06`), and redirect HTTP→HTTPS. Disable weak ciphers and old protocol versions everywhere.",
      "references": [
        "https://docs.aws.amazon.com/elasticloadbalancing/latest/classic/elb-security-policy-table.html"
      ]
    },
